      "description": "Header anchor group; login stays visible when the central navigation hides.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-nav-field\"><nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"#nicole\">Meet Nicole</a><a href=\"#coaching\">The coaching</a><a href=\"#apply\">Let\u2019s get started <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></a></nav><a class=\"ds-login\" href=\"/login\">Client login</a></div>",
