      "description": "Native disclosure with a rotating plus/minus.",
      "html": "<details class=\"ds-faq\"><summary>Can I train at home?<span class=\"ds-plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>Yes. Tell me what you have available, whether that\u2019s a gym membership, dumbbells and bands, or very little equipment. Your plan is built around what you can use.</p></details>",
      "css": ".ds-faq{border-block:1px solid #d6d6d1;color:#0d0d0f}.ds-faq summary{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;list-style:none;cursor:pointer;padding:25px 0;font:600 17px/1.4 var(--font-body,Barlow,\"Helvetica Neue\",Arial,sans-serif)}.ds-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.ds-faq summary:hover{color:var(--pink-700,#C9004E)}.ds-faq summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--pink-700,#C9004E);outline-offset:5px;}.ds-plus{position:relative;flex-shrink:0;width:16px;height:16px}.ds-plus::before,.ds-plus::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;width:14px;height:1.5px;background:currentColor;top:7px;left:1px}.ds-plus::after{transform:rotate(90deg);transition:transform 140ms ease}.ds-faq[open] .ds-plus::after{transform:rotate(0)}.ds-faq p{font-family:var(--font-body,Barlow,\"Helvetica Neue\",Arial,sans-serif);padding:0 28px 26px 0;margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:#55555d}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-plus::after{transition:none}}"
